- **TDD RED→GREEN:** the 13-criterion suite (11 canonical Exercism cases + shape/signature sanity) ran against a byte-identical stub copy first → **1/13** (`tests/red_evidence.log`, stub returns `None`), then against the implementation → **13/13** (`tests/green_evidence.log`).
